{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["ולא נודע כי באו אל קרבנה — So Pharaoh now said to Yosef: 'Now I recall that at the time of the dream it seemed as though they had not come into her innards.' But above it was not fitting to write anything but the eating that he saw — that this one ate that one. But what Pharaoh thought in his heart about what was puzzling him — that their appearance was bad as at the beginning — was not fitting to write."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:46:52.670912546Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}